 "title_en": "Radicals in Chinese Characters",
 "free": false,
 "audio_url": null,
 "note_en": "A 部首 (bùshǒu) or radical is the part of a character that often hints at its meaning. The pattern 跟……有关系 means \"to be related to...\": 这个字应该跟水有关系 \"this character must have something to do with water.\" Notice that the thing it relates to comes in the middle, between 跟 and 有关系, while English puts it at the end.",
 "sentences": [
